<Placemark><name>Metro North Corporate Park — old GE / Honeywell campus</name><description>Abandoned
13610 N Black Canyon Hwy, Phoenix, AZ 85029

~750k sq ft of vacant office buildings on 40+ acres at the SWC of I-17 &amp; Thunderbird. GE tech campus in the 60s, then Honeywell. Sold Sept 2026 ($28.6M); new owner plans to demolish for a 3-building industrial park, so it may become a construction site.

https://www.connectcre.com/stories/dimension-moving-ahead-on-3-building-n-phoenix-industrial-park/</description><styleUrl>#abandoned</styleUrl><Point><coordinates>-112.11873,33.60812,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
