801 S 16th St, Phoenix, AZ 85034

&#x27;For lease — industrial space&#x27; sign on the fence along E Grant St. Large fenced industrial lot, ~24 ac.</description><styleUrl>#forlease</styleUrl><Point><coordinates>-112.045611,33.441333,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Office building — 2211 S 47th St</name><description>Vacant
2211 S 47th St, Phoenix, AZ 85034 (entrance on E Hilton Ave)

